<template name="config-menu__jfg_visuals">
    <head>
    </head>
    <body>
        <form class="config__form">
            <div class="config__hz-wrapper">
                <!-- Options (generated by tools/gen_jfg_config_rml.py) -->
                <div class="config__wrapper" data-event-mouseout="set_cur_config_index(-1)" style="overflow-y: auto; height: 100%;">

                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Display</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(0)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Widescreen</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(0)" name="jfg_widescreen" data-checked="widescreen" value="1" id="jfg_widescreen_on" style="nav-up: #tab_jfg_visuals"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_widescreen_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(0)" name="jfg_widescreen" data-checked="widescreen" value="0" id="jfg_widescreen_off" style="nav-up: #tab_jfg_visuals"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_widescreen_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(1)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Field of View</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{fov}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(1)" id="jfg_fov_input" type="range" min="75" max="140" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp;" data-value="fov"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(2)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Frame Rate</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(2)" name="jfg_frame_rate" data-checked="frame_rate" value="0" id="jfg_frame_rate_0"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_frame_rate_0">Original</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(2)" name="jfg_frame_rate" data-checked="frame_rate" value="1" id="jfg_frame_rate_1"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_frame_rate_1">60</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(2)" name="jfg_frame_rate" data-checked="frame_rate" value="2" id="jfg_frame_rate_2"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_frame_rate_2">60 + Interpolated</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(3)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Disable LOD</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(3)" name="jfg_no_lod" data-checked="no_lod" value="1" id="jfg_no_lod_on"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_no_lod_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(3)" name="jfg_no_lod" data-checked="no_lod" value="0" id="jfg_no_lod_off"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_no_lod_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(4)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Draw Distant Objects</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(4)" name="jfg_far_objects" data-checked="far_objects" value="1" id="jfg_far_objects_on"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_far_objects_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(4)" name="jfg_far_objects" data-checked="far_objects" value="0" id="jfg_far_objects_off"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_far_objects_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(5)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Show FPS</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(5)" name="jfg_show_fps" data-checked="show_fps" value="1" id="jfg_show_fps_on"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_show_fps_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(5)" name="jfg_show_fps" data-checked="show_fps" value="0" id="jfg_show_fps_off"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_show_fps_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(6)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Show Level</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(6)" name="jfg_show_level" data-checked="show_level" value="1" id="jfg_show_level_on"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_show_level_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(6)" name="jfg_show_level" data-checked="show_level" value="0" id="jfg_show_level_off"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_show_level_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Fly Camera (F7)</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(7)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Fly Speed</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{fly_speed}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(7)" id="jfg_fly_speed_input" type="range" min="10" max="1000" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp;" data-value="fly_speed"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(8)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Freeze While Flying</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(8)" name="jfg_fly_freeze" data-checked="fly_freeze" value="1" id="jfg_fly_freeze_on"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_fly_freeze_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(8)" name="jfg_fly_freeze" data-checked="fly_freeze" value="0" id="jfg_fly_freeze_off"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_fly_freeze_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(9)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Hide HUD While Flying</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(9)" name="jfg_fly_hide_hud" data-checked="fly_hide_hud" value="1" id="jfg_fly_hide_hud_on"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_fly_hide_hud_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(9)" name="jfg_fly_hide_hud" data-checked="fly_hide_hud" value="0" id="jfg_fly_hide_hud_off"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_fly_hide_hud_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Ambient Occlusion</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(10)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Ambient Occlusion (SSAO)</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(10)" name="jfg_ssao" data-checked="ssao" value="1" id="jfg_ssao_on"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_ssao_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(10)" name="jfg_ssao" data-checked="ssao" value="0" id="jfg_ssao_off"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_ssao_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(11)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">SSAO Strength</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{ssao_strength}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(11)" id="jfg_ssao_strength_input" type="range" min="10" max="300" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp;" data-value="ssao_strength"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(12)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">SSAO Radius</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{ssao_radius}}</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(12)" id="jfg_ssao_radius_input" type="range" min="10" max="300" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp;" data-value="ssao_radius"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Bloom</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(13)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Bloom</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(13)" name="jfg_bloom" data-checked="bloom" value="1" id="jfg_bloom_on"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_bloom_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(13)" name="jfg_bloom" data-checked="bloom" value="0" id="jfg_bloom_off"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_bloom_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(14)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Bloom Intensity</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{bloom_intensity}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(14)" id="jfg_bloom_intensity_input" type="range" min="0" max="300" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp;" data-value="bloom_intensity"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(15)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Bloom Threshold</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{bloom_threshold}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(15)" id="jfg_bloom_threshold_input" type="range" min="0" max="100" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp;" data-value="bloom_threshold"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(16)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Bloom Radius</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{bloom_radius}}</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(16)" id="jfg_bloom_radius_input" type="range" min="1" max="20" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp;" data-value="bloom_radius"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
                <!-- Descriptions -->
                <div class="config__wrapper">
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 0">During gameplay the 3D view fills the window; the HUD stays in the middle. Things at the far left and right may appear late.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 1">Widens or narrows the view during gameplay, relative to each level's own field of view. Cutscenes, menus, the pause screen and zoomed scopes keep the game's own.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 2"><b>Original</b>: 30, dropping to 20 like the N64. <b>60</b>: the game updates every video frame; game speed stays the same. <b>60 + Interpolated</b>: the renderer also adds in-between frames up to your monitor's refresh rate; some moving objects may look off.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 3">Characters and objects keep their full-detail model at any distance.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 4">Objects no longer fade out and disappear beyond their draw distance. Level scenery itself is not affected.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 5">The game's frame rate in the top right corner.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 6">The level number and name in the top right corner.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 7">F7 (or F10 > Tools) flies a free camera for screenshots: WASD / left stick move where it looks, mouse / right stick look, Space / A up, Ctrl / B down, holding fire flies faster. F7 again ends it.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 8">The game stands still while the fly camera is on (enemies, effects and the level stop as when paused).</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 9">The health meter and the rest of the HUD are hidden while the fly camera is on.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 10">Darkens creases, corners and the ground around objects, worked out from the depth of the 3D view. The HUD is not affected.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 11">How dark the ambient occlusion gets.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 12">How far around a surface ambient occlusion looks, in game units.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 13">Bright parts of the 3D view (lights, explosions, sky, shots) glow softly into their surroundings. The HUD does not glow.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 14">How strong the glow is.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 15">How bright a colour must be to glow. Lower: more of the picture glows.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 16">How far the glow spreads.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </form>
    </body>
</template>
